WEBVTT

00:03:26.788 --> 00:03:31.413
the audience. Now, before a drag show,
I actually like to do Muslim prayers,

00:03:31.413 --> 00:03:35.121
and it helps me to feel really spiritually
grounded and a show is

00:03:35.121 --> 00:03:36.829
a kind of religious experience.

00:03:36.829 --> 00:03:40.913
Aroon United in the in the sort of
celebration of queerness and difference.

00:03:41.788 --> 00:03:44.829
When a show goes particularly well,
it gives me a kind of faith,

00:03:45.204 --> 00:03:48.871
a faith that maybe even Allah's plan was
for me to twirl around on a skirt

00:03:48.954 --> 00:03:51.413
on stage to find not only myself,

00:03:51.579 --> 00:03:54.621
but Allah like Surfest Muslims
centuries before me.

00:03:55.829 --> 00:03:58.288
So I'm not a fully traditional Muslim.

00:03:58.329 --> 00:04:01.496
And you know what you think
is the normal sense now.